### CONSULTAR PACIENTES
GET http://localhost/api_rest_agrored/php/usuario.php
Accept: application/json
### REGISTRAR PACIENTE
POST http://localhost/api_rest_agrored/php/usuario.php
Content-Type: application/json

### ELIMINAR PACIENTE 
DELETE http://localhost/api_rest_agrored/php/usuario.php?id_usuario=13
Accept: application/json

